<%- include("partials/header", { title, navLinks, activePath }) %>

<main class="container py-4">
  <section class="panel hero-panel">
    <div>
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        This site focuses on cybersecurity fundamentals and explains why this topic matters for
        students, workers, and everyday internet users. Instead of only listing definitions,
        each page gives practical examples so it is easier to connect concepts with real online situations.
      </p>
    </div>
    <img class="hero-image" src="/img/cybersecurity-shield.png" alt="Cybersecurity shield illustration">
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>What you will find in this mini guide</h2>
    <p>
      The content is organized into threats, protection practices, incident response basics,
      and security awareness habits. Together, these sections create a simple study reference
      that can help you identify common risks and take safer actions while using digital platforms.
    </p>
    <p>
      The goal is to keep everything readable and concise, while still giving enough context
      to understand how attacks happen and how to reduce their impact in daily life.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <h2>Current Threat Intelligence</h2>
        <p class="section-note">
          These are recent entries from the CISA catalog of vulnerabilities that are known to be actively exploited.
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="badge text-bg-dark">Catalog items shown: <%= kevFeed.vulnerabilities.length %></span>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid">
      <% kevFeed.vulnerabilities.forEach((item) => { %>
        <article class="data-card">
          <p class="card-label"><%= item.cveID %></p>
          <h3><%= item.product %></h3>
          <p><strong>Vendor:</strong> <%= item.vendorProject %></p>
          <p><strong>Added:</strong> <%= item.dateAdded %></p>
          <p><%= item.vulnerabilityName %></p>
        </article>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>
